# Simulator-regenerable datasets are provisioned on demand by the consuming
# scripts' `should_simulate()` bootstrap (see any scripts/*/*/simulator.py
# consumer) — they must NOT be committed. Everything under dataset/ is ignored.
# This workspace has no real/external committed data (the interferometer
# simulator generates its uv-coverage inline), so there is no `!dataset/...`
# allowlist, unlike autolens_workspace_test; the dataset-allowlist guard
# (PyAutoHands check_dataset_allowlist.py) treats a bare `dataset/` as Group B.
dataset/

# Generated artifacts — never check in
image.fits
path/
scripts/path/
scripts/scripts/
# `**/images/` covers all dataset types (imaging/, ellipse/, interferometer/,
# quantity/, point_source/, ...) — replaces the per-type entries that used to
# live here. Mirrors the autolens_workspace_test pattern.
**/images/
output_path/
root.log
.codex/
